Error: `&http` lends a child, and `http` takes no handle
   ╭─[ src/main.inset:4:21 ]
   │
 4 │     start Greeter { http: &http };
   │                     ─────┬─────  
   │                          ╰─────── `&` in a `start` statement lends a child to a later sibling
